================================================================================
Third-party material
================================================================================
Third-party material is NOT relicensed by this package. Vendor documentation
and third-party source trees are not redistributed here. The build evidence
(build_evidence/) holds the project files, reports, logs, and bitstreams that
the vendor tools produced from the test design of this package; the output
products that the vendor tools generate for their IP cores are left out. Public repositories examined in the evaluation remain under
their own upstream licenses and are referenced by pinned commit identifier
rather than copied into this package. The PolarFire SoC PLL configuration in
boards/disco/pf_ccc.tcl is derived from Microchip's Discovery Kit reference
design (MIT).
